{"src":"en","tgt":"tr","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":163000,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"tr","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":8062.561770999999,"text":"If you have watched the movie National Treasure, you may think a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"text","t":9314.646563999999,"text":"National Treasure filmini izlediyseniz, Bağımsızlık Bildirgesi'nin arkasına bir hazine haritası yazıldığını düşünebilirsiniz."},{"kind":"audio","t":9473.84785,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9477.37725,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":9481.082437,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9486.452465,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9491.913161999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9495.466752,"samples":23126,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":720},{"kind":"input","t":13886.279293,"text":"The hot chocolate is up to Belgian standards. Fruit juices are pricey, but after a while, you'll be able to taste the sweetness."},{"kind":"text","t":14720.389611999999,"text":"Sıcak çikolata Belçika standartlarında. Meyve suları pahalıdır ama bir süre sonra tatlılığını alabileceksiniz."},{"kind":"audio","t":14793.094222,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14797.215462,"samples":29925,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":14825.867884,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14830.964787,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":14836.366555,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14837.097702,"samples":8693,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":120},{"kind":"input","t":22225.94799,"text":"However, that is not true. Although there is something written on the back of the document, it is not a treasure map."},{"kind":"text","t":23070.621669,"text":"Ancak bu doğru değil. Belgenin arkasında bir şeyler yazılı olsa da, bu bir hazine haritası değil."},{"kind":"audio","t":23136.708491999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23137.240423,"samples":4290,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":120},{"kind":"audio","t":23178.645477,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23183.987566,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23189.367115,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":23190.428487,"samples":11201,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":400},{"kind":"input","t":29991.356557,"text":"You may also wish to consult the advice of governments other than your own, but their advice is designed for their citizens."},{"kind":"text","t":31408.053944,"text":"Kendi hükümetiniz dışındakilerin tavsiyelerine de danışmak isteyebilirsiniz, ancak onların tavsiyeleri kendi vatandaşları için tasarlanmıştır."},{"kind":"audio","t":31565.030138000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31569.687687999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31574.942509,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31580.14232,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31585.535907999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31590.798588999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":31592.855484,"samples":16829,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":550},{"kind":"input","t":41578.895131,"text":"Hong Kong Island gives the territory of Hong Kong its name and is a place that many tourists regard as the main focus."},{"kind":"text","t":42565.642788,"text":"Hong Kong Adası, Hong Kong bölgesine adını verir ve birçok turistin ana odak noktası olarak gördüğü bir yerdir."},{"kind":"audio","t":42689.405878,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42694.339674,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42699.815011,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42704.968222999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42709.782181,"samples":30260,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1110},{"kind":"input","t":49105.556319,"text":"Anyone who's going to drive at hot latitudes or over mountain passes should consider the possibility of snow, ice, or free"},{"kind":"text","t":50563.312036,"text":"Sıcak enlemlerde veya dağ geçitlerinde araç kullanacak olan herkes; kar, buz veya don olasılığını göz önünde bulundurmalıdır."},{"kind":"audio","t":50685.711359,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50690.627615,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50695.870476,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50697.069956,"samples":10922,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":290},{"kind":"audio","t":50703.321359,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50708.707177,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":50711.48567,"samples":19448,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":690},{"kind":"input","t":58794.62309,"text":"Segregation and recombination shuffle variation back and forth between the two pools."},{"kind":"text","t":59652.305178,"text":"Ayrışma ve yeniden birleşme, varyasyonu iki havuz arasında ileri geri karıştırır."},{"kind":"audio","t":59761.179932,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59766.071958,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59771.320459,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":59775.421509,"samples":26247,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":910},{"kind":"input","t":61289.78797,"text":"with each generation."},{"kind":"text","t":61551.816733,"text":"her nesilde."},{"kind":"audio","t":61582.038358,"samples":26192,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":960},{"kind":"input","t":66503.696108,"text":"The term bug is used by entomologists in a formal sense for this group of insects."},{"kind":"text","t":67417.181374,"text":"Entomologlar, böceklerin bu grubu için \"bug\" terimini resmi bir anlamda kullanırlar."},{"kind":"audio","t":67515.916991,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67520.96945500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67526.381743,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":67530.107889,"samples":24297,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":900},{"kind":"input","t":74699.067486,"text":"First, most riders wearing riding boots with a heel and a smooth, quite narrow sole."},{"kind":"text","t":75693.795196,"text":"Öncelikle, binicilerin çoğu topuklu ve düz, oldukça dar tabanlı binici botları giyiyordu."},{"kind":"audio","t":75802.06824000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75807.09718400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75812.47924300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75817.727843,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":75818.70412600001,"samples":9640,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"input","t":83916.97623900001,"text":"The commission was Martelli's response to widespread anti-regime protests that started in October."},{"kind":"text","t":84906.76753400001,"text":"Komisyon, Martelli'nin Ekim ayında başlayan yaygın rejim karşıtı protestolara verdiği bir yanıttı."},{"kind":"audio","t":85019.897125,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85024.86596000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85030.274608,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85035.733405,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85037.86472900001,"samples":15770,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":420},{"kind":"input","t":91198.51163600001,"text":"Fire rescue crews eventually doused the fire by 11.35pm."},{"kind":"text","t":92224.44605500001,"text":"İtfaiye ekipleri yangını saat 23.35'e kadar söndürdü."},{"kind":"audio","t":92316.35671800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92321.320783,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92326.534784,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":92326.905538,"samples":4792,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":120},{"kind":"input","t":97372.148312,"text":"The tensioning storm of the Atlantic hurricane season, Subtropic Storm Jerry,"},{"kind":"text","t":98392.859179,"text":"Atlantik kasırga sezonunun gerilimi artıran fırtınası, Subtropikal Fırtına Jerry,"},{"kind":"audio","t":98496.00757100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98500.99883600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98506.412784,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98511.59723500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":98511.954029,"samples":1838,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":100228.74086,"text":"formed in the Atlantic Ocean today."},{"kind":"text","t":100758.113284,"text":"bugün Atlantik Okyanusu'nda oluştu."},{"kind":"audio","t":100814.860407,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100819.010106,"samples":28532,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"input","t":107458.134596,"text":"It has brought us to train the car and many other transportation devices."},{"kind":"text","t":108207.801395,"text":"Bu bizi arabayı ve diğer birçok ulaşım aracını eğitmemize götürdü."},{"kind":"audio","t":108289.763497,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108294.68643300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108299.94427400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":108300.12600100001,"samples":55,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":116620.967038,"text":"It's renowned for being an epicenter of luxury began in about 400 AD and lasted up a"},{"kind":"text","t":117575.701121,"text":"Yaklaşık MS 400 yılında başlayan ve ... kadar süren bir lüks merkezi olmasıyla tanınır."},{"kind":"audio","t":117638.171646,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117642.808877,"samples":30761,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":117664.27533100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117669.468112,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":117669.879765,"samples":4959,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":90},{"kind":"input","t":120894.54004800001,"text":"until about 1100 A.D."},{"kind":"text","t":121478.937865,"text":"yaklaşık MS 1100 yılına kadar."},{"kind":"audio","t":121547.471806,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":121551.20802300001,"samples":26860,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":970},{"kind":"input","t":127419.81704800001,"text":"The surface of the moon is made of rocks and dust. The outer layer of the moon is called the crust."},{"kind":"text","t":127971.36438500001,"text":"Ay'ın yüzeyi kaya ve tozdan oluşur. Ay'ın dış katmanına kabuk denir."},{"kind":"audio","t":128050.04487400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128053.78573,"samples":25746,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1010},{"kind":"audio","t":128059.07994000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":630,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":128064.309641,"samples":32433,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1230},{"kind":"input","t":134215.044487,"text":"The U.S. Corps of Engineers estimated that six inches of rainfall could breach the previously damaged"},{"kind":"text","t":135341.120208,"text":"ABD İstihkam Kuvvetleri, altı inçlik yağışın daha önce hasar görmüş olan kısmı aşabileceğini tahmin etti."},{"kind":"audio","t":135468.2833,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135471.001364,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":135474.338877,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135477.73042900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135481.08035200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":135481.451906,"samples":4458,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":141182.41820000001,"text":"In particular, it is claimed that one can detect whether a person is lying by interpreting micro-expressions correctly."},{"kind":"text","t":142313.83266000001,"text":"Özellikle, mikro ifadelerin doğru yorumlanmasıyla bir kişinin yalan söyleyip söylemediğinin tespit edilebileceği iddia edilmektedir."},{"kind":"audio","t":142460.22731400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142465.216129,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142470.596338,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142476.101224,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":142481.098869,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142485.437615,"samples":32322,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"input","t":147231.816904,"text":"Do not deface the site by marking or scratching graffiti into structure."},{"kind":"text","t":147944.08045,"text":"Yapıya yazı yazarak veya çizikler atarak siteyi tahrip etmeyin."},{"kind":"audio","t":148018.538081,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148021.684417,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148024.22418400002,"samples":25857,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":970},{"kind":"input","t":154877.121029,"text":"The tiger's roar is not like the full-voiced roar of a lion, but more like a sentence of snarly, shouted words."},{"kind":"text","t":156356.3299,"text":"Kaplanın kükremesi, bir aslanın gür kükremesi gibi değil, daha çok hırlayarak bağırılan kelimelerden oluşan bir cümle gibidir."},{"kind":"audio","t":156497.78851800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":156502.616646,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156507.766498,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156513.053768,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156518.424076,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156520.924994,"samples":24798,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":820},{"kind":"input","t":161915.416023,"text":"20th century research has shown that there are two pools of genetic variation, hidden and expressed."},{"kind":"text","t":162947.89468,"text":"20. yüzyıl araştırmaları, gizli ve ifade edilen olmak üzere iki genetik varyasyon havuzu olduğunu göstermiştir."},{"kind":"audio","t":162984.08539300002,"samples":13653,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":550},{"kind":"audio","t":163096.87181,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163102.07316200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163107.082716,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163112.336457,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163117.543488,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":163117.862702,"samples":1393,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":173205.38450000001,"code":1005}]}